OL,11,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,12,     FJuan Diego Florez returns to the
OL,13,     FVienna State Opera as the new
OL,14,     Fleader of Ceylon's pearl
OL,15,     Ffishermen, where the friendship of
OL,16,     Ftwo men is threatened by love for
OL,17,     Fthe same woman.
